WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.000
 (silence)

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.840
 You roll in loud like you own the place

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:26.000
 Dropping punchlines no one wants to chase

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
 Always got a story but it's full of holes

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.720
 Every word a show for their quilted souls

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:40.240
 Saying once again, gotta flex your grin

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:43.840
 But you never win, you never win

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:50.000
 Shutting all the time just to feel the air

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.000
 Never knowing where to zip it up

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:01.600
 Talking about their chains in some plastic chair

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:06.800
 Making noise but never enough

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:13.920
 Bing, hey, yeah, whoa, whoa, whoa

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:19.840
 Opinions flying faster than their cheap guitars

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:25.840
 Tried me through the room just like old cigars

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:31.840
 Pushing every bite until you break cold brews

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:35.840
 Living for attention they will always lose

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:38.840
 Spin it round and round

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:41.840
 Drink it up so loud

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:44.840
 But it all falls down

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:49.840
 It all falls down

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:55.840
 Shutting all the time just to feel the air

00:01:55.840 --> 00:02:01.840
 Never knowing where to zip it up

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:07.840
 Talking about their chains in some plastic chair

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:14.840
 Making noise but never enough

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:16.840
